WEBVTT

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.450
You over there!

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.230
I'll keep the enemy busy, 
so protect Asao!

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.550
What?! I'm injured!

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.910
But you're still no "mere human," right?

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.640
Dammit...

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.890
But how are you planning 
to draw them off?

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.920
It can't be helped...

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.630
Huh?

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.590
My name is Nobunagun!

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:02.150
You monsters! Let us...

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.780
...have a fair fight!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:40.920
Gun No. 2: Evolutionary Invasion Objects

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.430
Why can't I hit them?!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.860
Hey, cut out the rapid fire! The recoil 
is jerkin' your body all over the place!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.430
But...

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.910
You're not gonna hit 'em, 
no matter how much you fire!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.830
Gah, she's such an amateur.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.510
Asao! Ogura!

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.120
Our teacher?!

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.670
What are you doing? 
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.500
Hit' em, hit 'em, 
hit 'em, hit 'em!

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.610
This thing kicks like a mule!

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.270
You're late.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.260
5 gs.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.650
Hey, you! Get on with it!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.420
You can hit a target that's stopped 
moving, can't you?

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.770
If you hit me, I'll stomp you dead.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:55.830
Newton!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.420
Hi, Jack!

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.730
No more stealin' the march, 
all right?

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:05.010
If you'd cut that out, you wouldn't 
end up with such a draft in your chest.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.480
What about Gandhi?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.160
Behind you.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.300
Once that's sorted, can you do 
me a favor and get these?

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:18.400
Jack the Ripper is unfit for combat, 
so the only one with any attack power is...

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.140
...you, right?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.490
Newton, and Gandhi! 
Back up Nobunagun!

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:29.620
Is it really okay to do this? 
That girl has no training...

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:34.350
Oda Nobunaga. 
He was an interesting fellow.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.200
She'll be fine.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:40.540
That guy's battle smarts 
are a cut above.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.230
But...

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.200
This one already?

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.430
Barriers, the power to 
change gravity...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.410
Okay! I think we might 
be able to do this!

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.930
Hmph! Whadaya think <i>you're</i> gonna come up 
with off the top of your amateur head?

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.980
Just so you know, 
all my power can do is...

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:09.010
...make things I step on heavier.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.880
It's impossible for me to do something 
like stop all these guys in their tracks at once.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:18.540
That's okay. One is enough.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:19.910
Huh?

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:24.410
Gandhi, take Jack and Asao and 
protect them inside the tower.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.610
But— I'll fight, too!

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.210
I'm supposed to protect the attacke—

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.640
Please do as I say!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.480
If anything happens to Asao...

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.810
...not even I know what I'll do.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.250
Got it.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.370
What's the evacuation status?

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.400
It seems to be largely complete.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:50.180
The Taiwanese army concentrated their force 
exclusively on rescue efforts for us.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.680
If only they had done that 
in the first place!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:59.030
Unfortunately, not every last country 
has been notified about the enemy.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.840
Saint-Germain, please proceed with 
preparations for the press conference.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.750
Once this battle is finished, we'll inform 
the whole world of the truth!

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:27.920
Here they come! Do it.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.600
Sheesh... you must be crazy.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.040
3 gs.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:39.280
This'll be able to...

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.000
...suppress the recoil!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.660
We're screwed! There're too many!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:54.920
They're coming around 
your right flank!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.580
The enemy is Takeda's calvary!

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.030
Even if you have a rifle squad,

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:09.020
a single line will be broken 
while they reload.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:13.290
What you must do is simple.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.700
If one line isn't enough...

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.160
...two!

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.070
From above!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.530
If two lines isn't enough...

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.510
...three!

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.990
The Nobunagun Three-Line Volley!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.750
Nobunaga's Three-Line Volley...

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.910
I thought it was a myth.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.900
With contemporary common sense,

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:59.140
we have no way of estimating 
his skill in battle.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.150
Oh no!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.640
At close range...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.870
I can hit 'em!

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:18.990
This chick...

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.960
...is frickin' smiling?!

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:35.950
Are there any left?

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.180
None that are moving.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.740
Oh... that's good.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.070
Hey!

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.230
It's to be expected.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:54.300
She has no training, and was attacking 
repeatedly with an AU weapon.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:58.760
Considering all that, it's amazing she took out 
that many Invasion Objects.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:01.910
How's Asao?

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:05.990
Safe. But we should have a doctor 
take a look at her right away.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:09.830
Take care of yourself before worrying 
about someone else.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.670
That goes for you, too, Jack.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.890
Well... the one I took down was bigger.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.610
The enemy is silent.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:21.330
No moving Objects detected.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.910
How many did she take 
out in the end?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.360
202.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:27.760
Is that so...

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.610
What's that?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.660
Detecting high-level heat!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.920
It's coming from the one 
Jack the Ripper defeated!

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.100
What's wrong, Newton?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.030
That thing's mass is increasing like crazy!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.770
There's a ridiculous amount of energy 
being generated inside.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.310
It's just like a balloon full of air!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.410
Oh, shit! Is that one 
gonna pop it?!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.560
It's gonna blow!

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:32.330
Right now, the world's good intentions
are gathered in this land to help the victims.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.890
But whenever anyone tries 
to save anybody,

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:40.970
they are crushed by 
their helplessness.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:46.610
It's probably sunk in by now, how horrible 
the Evolutionary Invasion Objects are.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:49.000
But at the same time, you must have 
realized something else:

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:53.270
how powerful the E-gene holders 
are, who keep them at bay.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:03.680
It's been 430 years, huh, 
Oda Nobunaga.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:11.300
Evolutionary Invasion Objects... 
I knew they would come to this planet.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:15.430
That's why I extracted the genes of 
distinguished individuals,

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:17.640
enriched them, and left them 
to future generations.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.930
The only weapons that are a 
match for the Objects

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:26.880
are AU weapons, and I want you to 
lend me your strength and use one.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.850
Of course, I won't pressure you,

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:34.960
because you're not Oda Nobunaga, 
but Ogura Sio.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:41.700
It could mean abandoning the lifestyle 
you've been building for yourself so far.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:46.260
No, not only your lifestyle, 
your very life.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.260
It's fine to reply once you've 
returned to Japan.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.360
Arguing that way to 
a sensitive child...

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.770
It's a harsh way to 
go about things.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:13.470
It's just like that time in the remote 
past when you scouted me.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:20.210
We can't help it. We need her power, 
no matter what.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:24.510
Right now,
 she must be so bewildered...

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:28.800
...at the spirit of Oda Nobunaga 
that was sleeping inside her,

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.870
and the power that must 
exceed her imagination.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:35.610
But that power is the key...

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:41.900
...the key to making sure this planet 
doesn't meet the fate of my own.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:49.610
Key though she may be, 
we mustn't force the lock.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.500
We at Dogoo are...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:02.780
...a supranational organization established 
behind closed doors in preparation for this day.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.790
You may have heard that creatures 
recently appeared in Taiwan.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:09.130
Those creatures, which we call 
Evolutionary Invasion Objects,

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:12.680
are immune to conventional weapons.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:15.600
The only powers able to oppose them

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:20.300
are members of Dogoo who carry a 
special element called an E-gene.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.940
We call them E-gene holders.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.170
In order to protect humanity from the 
dreadful Evolutionary Invasion Objects...

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:29.780
No... to protect all life on Earth...

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:33.480
Today, along with the announcement 
of our presence,

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:37.730
we are requesting the support of 
everyone around the world.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.390
<b>Live </b>

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.390
Japan is a member of Dogoo.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:57.850
<b>E-gene test</b>

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.850
Why the hell?!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.800
Please donate!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.810
<b>Fundrasing Box
We humbly request your support.</b>

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.150
<b>Bonkisha!</b>

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.150
<b>Are E-gene holders manipulating politicians?</b>

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:04.690
<b>Model announces herself as E-gene holder! </b>

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.320
<b>Is it okay to put our faith in Dogoo?! </b>

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:17.500
The emergency press conference called 
regarding the events in Taiwan

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:20.540
has shocked the entire world.

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.500
Man, this has been all over the 
news since this morning.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:30.250
We finally got back to Japan, 
and the shows we want to see aren't even on.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.410
Umm...

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.600
Are you okay? How are you?

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:42.850
If nothing's wrong in my checkup at the beginning 
of the week, I can go home next week.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.030
That's good...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.130
It's thanks to you, Sio.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.410
Asao...?

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.870
Why did you invite me 
with you that time?

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:03.940
To go into the old dude?

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:10.060
Well, I've just always wondered 
about you.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:11.560
Why?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.800
I guess it must've been 
in our first year...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:18.800
You were pretending to look at the textbook, 
but were actually reading a book about tanks.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:23.470
What? Oh! Th-That's because— My mom— 
I dunno why, but she loves that stuff!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:26.620
If we're watching movies,
 it's always monsters or war!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:32.080
I guess I'm a freak, huh.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.760
No!

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:38.200
I've always kinda admired you...

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.790
...for being someone who doesn't 
conform to everybody else.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.290
You did?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.400
I was finally able to tell you.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.880
What is an Evolutionary Invasion 
Object, exactly?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:56.330
Well, the only information we 
have at present is based

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.800
on the limited amount of documentation 
offered by Dogoo,

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.150
but the Evolutionary Invasion Objects are thought 
to have flown in about 10 years ago

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:05.990
on a tiny meteorite.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.940
They then fell into 
the Pacific Ocean.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:13.800
Their cells began evolving in order to take a 
form appropriate to Earth's environment.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.240
<b>2007: Johnston Atoll, 
Torpedo class </b>

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.700
<b> 2008: Hawaii, 
Cruiser class</b>

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:19.940
This diagram lines up the types of Evolutionary 
Invasion Objects Dogoo has faced in past battles

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.440
<b> 2011: Bikini Atoll, 
 Cruiser class</b>

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.770
in the order they appeared.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.620
<b> 2012: Saipan, 
 Heavy Cruiser class</b>

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.620
For the moment, they resemble fish,

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.290
<b> 2012: Saipan, 
 Gunboat class</b>

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:29.700
but before long, they'll probably develop 
to amphibian and reptile level.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:32.630
Their aim is to emerge on land.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:37.110
In other words, it is thought that 
they'll invade not only our oceans,

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.630
but Earth as a whole, 
taking over the entire ecosystem.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.980
Whoa... so they were monsters 
from outer space.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:50.230
It's sorta like that one movie... 
umm, you know!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:52.630
Oh! <i>Gamera 2: Attack of the Legion</i>?

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:00.030
No, it's a Hollywood sci-fi flick, but...

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.580
...that sounds interesting. 
I'll rent it soon!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.830
The— The special effects 
are amazing...

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:12.340
This is a video taken 
by a tourist in Taiwan. 

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.830
If you can believe it, this girl has been identified 
as a Japanese high school student.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:23.250
That girl is a holder we were not aware of.
She just happened to be there.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:27.470
However, participation in Dogoo 
is strictly voluntary.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.290
We will respect her decision.

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:34.570
Should I turn it off?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.370
N-Nah, it's fine...

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:43.740
Taiwan ended up such a mess. 
Couldn't Japan be next?

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:48.360
There are only a select group of people 
who can fight those monsters, right?

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:50.780
Hm? If it were me?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.120
Of course I'd go!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:58.650
Take a look at Taiwan! We have to do whatever 
we can to stop that from happening again!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:03.850
There's that saying, "With great power 
comes great responsibility."

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.540
It's for the world's sake, after all...!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.660
You can do it!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.730
Everyone's just saying whatever.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:18.970
You're going, huh?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.890
...Yeah.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.500
Mom and Dad will understand.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.370
Sio...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.900
Ever since I got back, 
I've been...

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.260
I'm so scared.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.740
The monsters scare me.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:42.550
The public's expectations and the stuff 
everyone is saying scare me.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.060
When you're suddenly told you've 
become some other thing,

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:53.160
you start to not even know 
who you are, yourself.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:55.120
It's scary.

00:18:55.490 --> 00:19:00.940
I'm just a kid, you know. 
Until now, a below average one.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:05.360
And then suddenly... 
Everything's so sudden...!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:07.970
Asao.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.410
You said you were saved 
thanks to me, right?

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:14.310
Well... yeah.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.040
But that's not true.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.320
Back there...

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.000
It's just like a balloon full of air!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.500
What?

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:31.440
There's still one alive...

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:38.050
I can't do this... 
I've got nothing left.

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:39.600
No bullets...

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:42.990
Oh, shit! Is that one 
gonna pop it?!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:46.850
Asao!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:55.360
Back there... I couldn't do anything.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:02.180
You're safe now because of 
Gandhi and those guys...

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:09.220
Nah, I'm definitely alive 
thanks to you, Sio.

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.000
What?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:19.250
If you hadn't found me, I probably would've
died right there under that big old dude.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.940
So, remember:

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:25.610
Even if you can't take it anymore...

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:28.450
Even if you throw it all away, and run...

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:32.000
Even if the whole world is talking 
about you behind your back...

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.710
There will always be one person who 
believes in everything you do.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.430
Asao!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:45.270
Next time I'll risk <i>my</i> 
life to protect <i>you</i>.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.200
I owe it to you, after all.

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:50.730
No... that's not it.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.540
It's because we're friends.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.500
She just came out!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.120
You're Ogura Sio, right?

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:05.740
We've heard you'll be 
joining Dogoo?

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:10.190
I'm... not afraid anymore.

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:12.840
It's just like the other day.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:16.960
Even though I was stepping 
forward, I felt no fear.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:21.170
I had someone who was 
important to me!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.980
I wanted to protect her, 
that's all.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.510
<b>Sending...</b>

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.930
I'm... not afraid anymore!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:52.310
<b>OGURA SIO</b>

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:54.990
<b>JOINS DOGOO</b>

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.250
